<section class="approach" id="approach" data-section="working-together">
  <div class="approach-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">WORKING TOGETHER</p>
    <h2>From your idea<br />to a working product.</h2>
    <div class="person">
      <img
        src="/assets/portfolio/previews/jithu-avatar.jpg"
        alt="Jithu Sunny"
        width="72"
        height="72"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <p>You work directly with me, from our first conversation to launch.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="working-path" data-section="working-path">
    <ol>
      <li>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Tell me what you need</h3>
        <p>We discuss your idea, your customers and what matters most.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Try a first version</h3>
        <p>We agree on the first useful result. You see the design or try a prototype.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Review as we build</h3>
        <p>You try it. We refine it together and check the complete experience.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Launch and improve</h3>
        <p>We get it ready for real use, then plan the next improvements.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="path-note">
      A small project can move quickly through these steps. Larger projects progress through agreed
      milestones.
    </p>
  </div>
